Package: shaman
Type: Package
Title: Sampling HiC Contact Matrices for Aparametric Normalization
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Amos", "Tanay", role=c("aut")),
    person("Netta", "Mendelson Cohen", email="netta.mendelsoncohen@weizmann.ac.il",
    role=c("aut")),
    person("Aviezer", "Lifshitz", email="aviezer.lifshitz@weizmann.ac.il",
    role=c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Generate expected HiC data maintaining marginal coverage,
  and the decay in contact probability with increasing genomic distance. Expected
  HiC data is used for normalization and graphical presentation of statistical
  significance of observed HiC contact enrichments.
